# The GAPG 18 August 2026 briefing deck is the styling source that build_deck.py
# clones from. It is deliberately NOT committed: its slides 4 and 8 are live
# portal screenshots carrying citizen names, mobile numbers and addresses, and
# the source file is marked not for circulation. Fetch it from Box before
# rebuilding. See README.md.
reference.pptx

# QA render byproducts. Regenerate with soffice + pdftoppm; see README.md.
# Any prefix: pdftoppm names its output after whatever the caller passes, and a
# `slide-*` pattern alone let a `rr-07.jpg` reach the index.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.pdf
